    \intertext{is derivable by \olref[pro]{prop:chain}. Using an appropriate instance of \olref[prp]{ax:land3} and two applications of~\MP, we see that}
    (\lforall[x][!A(x)] \land \lforall[y][!B(y)]) & \lif (!A(a) \land !B(a))\\
